  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Xiao Shan grabs Sun Pang Hu and Zhou Xing Xing and declares that their village shall be called Yi Tian Village and the mountain Yi Tian Mountain, urging loyalty among demonic path allies filled with mutual suspicion.",
      "chapters": [
        963
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xiao_shan",
        "char_sun_pang_hu",
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From partway up the mountain, a glimpse of Yi Tian Village shows through crevices between dense trees.",
      "chapters": [
        998
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Demonic path Gu Masters and lone cultivators join quickly; in six or seven days membership passes thirty, shocking even Xiao Shan. Among them he has the highest strength and reputation, and everyone chooses him as leader at the top ranking.",
      "chapters": [
        964
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "growth-and-leadership",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_demonic_path",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu clan, the super force closest to Yi Tian Mountain, sends the first major righteous attack after the village is created, and a beast group also engulfs the new settlement. Even after Wu Shen Tong is repelled the village takes a huge blow, until Lu Zuan Feng kills Wu Shen Tong by infiltration and ends that first wave. Lan Mei He and Fei You Wang later join and help push righteous path members back.",
      "chapters": [
        965
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-crises-and-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "char_wu_shen_tong",
        "char_lu_zuan_feng",
        "char_lan_mei_he",
        "char_fei_you_wang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan then steps onto Yi Tian Mountain disguised as a rank three Gu Master, joins outside the top one hundred, and is set to guard an archery tower while membership reaches about six hundred.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
